{"title":"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If both integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/b/a4b143dd085345dc8e90d189bb3459976592c654.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha,\\beta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> are bigger than 1 and satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/f/23f581e6667f84fef3980f40cc34c3bd0d9763cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^7=b^8$\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" />, then the minimum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/3/ce30a5e08706c5e6bcc4380f36ec0f3ba0507b6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha+\\beta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/a/3ea3a446dd57e2f3c62ec5e85a315ea6ac9f62e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 384\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 2\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 15\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 56\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 512$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"396\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and therefore not equal to zero, we can divide both sides of the equation by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/1/1b1a1a3d28da773525b1801bd2c69bf7ce687cb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^7$\" width=\"14\" height=\"15\" /> to obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/f/f0f0a7550bd7aa43bceacacfab79bca49113bbcb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^7/b^7=b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"19\" />, or\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c37d410a9ea0f6c3660316e40b39b28fc1d5a88.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(\\frac{a}{b}\\right)^7=b\\]\" width=\"71\" height=\"36\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is an integer, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/c/e0c22354f6f8870c3a024305aa3afed00b26bcf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a/b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" /> is an integer.  So, we can start testing out seventh powers of integers.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/6/446f9d7f069851a66d8c3dabfb4db49177abf374.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a/b=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"58\" height=\"18\" /> doesn't work, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are defined to be greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The next smallest thing we try is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e8f7bc574760d11929f3cfb42615e5734c95694.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a/b=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"59\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>This gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/9/7592e76e9736a1294c968da33cae17788152d35c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=(a/b)^7=2^7=128$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"171\" height=\"19\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/8/73825656547270efedef5355ba01dcfa297f535d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=2b=2(128)=256$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"176\" height=\"18\" />. Thus, our sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/6/1c6c054f486fd63e7249dfa0aa8a256da5b37a2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$128+256=384$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"128\" height=\"14\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/2/ca2f4283cfd441270cb90bfd2cf89a533f3dde81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2006 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\